BLACK BELT CONDUCT & ETHICAL DECISION FORM — TEMPLATE v2.0
For use with: Ollama / Llama 3.1 BBEA model (human-readable output format)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

This is the human-readable form the model learns to reference when producing
the signature_block and closure_summary. Training includes both JSON output
and this form structure so the model understands the "feel" of an auditor
document.

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

                BLACK BELT CONDUCT & ETHICAL DECISION FORM

Style:        ____________________________________
Rank:         ____________________________________
Organization: ____________________________________
Jurisdiction: United States
Date:         ____________________________________

