SECTION A — CONDUCT DOMAINS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  ☐ Technical Discipline
  ☐ Leadership (without coercion)
  ☐ Ethical Decision-Making
  ☐ Non-Discrimination
  ☐ Right to Refuse Misuse of Skill

