     "I acknowledge my right to choose non-violent resolution
      whenever reasonably possible."
     Initials: ______    ☐ Affirmed  ☐ Not Affirmed

  2. Prejudice & Discrimination
     "I understand that any prejudiced or discriminatory use of
      martial skill violates my rank and school ethics."
     Initials: ______    ☐ Compliant  ☐ Non-Compliant

  3. Law & Use of Force
     "I agree to align any use of force with applicable law and
      proportionality principles."
     Initials: ______    ☐ Aligned  ☐ Misaligned

